**Design Notes:**
- **find birch_leaves**: Uses both `position_inside_box` (agent must be near the tree) and `look_at_block` (must actually look at the leaves). The box is generous (~2 to ~9 on x/z) to allow the agent to be anywhere near the tree.
- **craft to dark_oak_button**: Simple `inventory_has` check — the agent starts without any buttons, so having one confirms successful crafting.
- **mine acacia_wall_sign**: Two rules — (1) `voxel_count_in_box` confirms the sign block is gone from its original position, and (2) `inventory_has` confirms the agent picked up the dropped sign item. Note: wall signs drop as regular sign items (`minecraft:acacia_sign`), not as `acacia_wall_sign`.

