| Task | Rule Type | Why |
|------|-----------|-----|
| find birch_leaves | position_near_with_facing | PREFERRED for find/locate tasks — models "player can see the target". Target is the center of the birch leaves canopy at (6, 4, 6) spawn-relative. max_distance=10 keeps it within the enclosure. facing_tolerance=60° ensures the agent is looking toward the tree. |
| craft to dark_oak_button | inventory_has | PREFERRED for craft tasks — the crafted item ends up in inventory. Player starts with 0 buttons, so min_count=1 confirms crafting occurred. |
| mine acacia_wall_sign | inventory_has | PREFERRED for mine tasks — the mined drop ends up in inventory. The wall sign drops as `acacia_sign` (bare name). min_count=1 confirms successful mining and pickup. |

